# Normalise line endings so the repository is the single source of truth rather
# than each contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
#
# LF everywhere, including Windows working copies. The alternative (CRLF on
# checkout) means a file edited on Windows and executed on Linux — the systemd
# unit, the Mosquitto config, anything CI runs — can carry \r into places that
# treat it as part of a value.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles are generated; collapsing them in diffs keeps review focused on
# hand-written changes.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
